	(text "+ Contact Batteries 11/12\n- Contact Batteries 11/12\nfuture expansion analog input (NC)\nfuture expansion analog input (NC)\nfuture expansion analog input (NC)\n+72V from the positive pole to the DC/DC enable\n If there is no voltage here, \n the DC/DC converter will not start when you give ignition."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 197.104 123.698 0)
		(effects
